    "title": "Sparkle Sweepers - Cleaning",
    "description": "Are you ready to transform your neighborhood, one house at a time? \r\nDive into the satisfying world of Sparkle Sweepers, the idle game where you take on the role of the ultimate house cleaner.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\nEasy Controls: Simply tap and swipe to clean. It's that easy!\r\nSatisfying Trash Collection: Experience the joy of picking up trash and watching the mess disappear.\r\nClean and Shine: Feel the satisfaction as each house goes from dirty to spotless.\r\nVariety of Houses and Stages: Explore different house shapes and stages, each with unique challenges.\r\nGet ready to clean, organize, and shine! Download Sparkle Sweepers now and become the hero of your neighborhood!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nEU / California users can opt-out under GDPR / CCPA.\r\nPlease respond from the pop-up displayed when starting in the app or within the settings in the app.",
